<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>第八批四线：静态消费者与运行硬门</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#101a29;color:#e7edf7;font:16px/1.8 "Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}main{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:24px}a{color:#9fd5ff}nav{position:sticky;top:0;background:#172638;padding:12px;z-index:2;display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}pre{overflow:auto;background:#09131f;padding:16px}code{font:13px/1.7 Consolas,monospace}table{border-collapse:collapse;display:block;overflow:auto}td,th{border:1px solid #45617e;padding:8px 12px}blockquote{border-left:4px solid #e7b667;margin:18px 0;padding:1px 16px;background:#203249}h1,h2,h3,h4{scroll-margin-top:85px}img{max-width:100%}.meta{font-size:12px;color:#a9bfd3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}summary{cursor:pointer}</style><nav><a href="../../../framework-architecture.html">主架构</a><a href="../../main-ui-map.html">逆向核心</a><a href="../index.html">关联文档目录</a><a data-source-download download href="../../../reverse/BATCH8-20261019.md">下载原始文件</a></nav><main><h1 id="第八批四线静态消费者与运行硬门">第八批四线：静态消费者与运行硬门</h1><p>基线 <code>5e76aee5546a29243c9d95c17d29c2e73080bceb</code>。执行前固定四个有限退出问题，A/C/D子智能并行、主智能负责B与整合。没有原目标运行、SDK初始化、注册表操作、产品修改或历史产品测试重跑；不自动推送，不读取或修改tool-plugins。</p>
